  "content": {
    "title": "关于开展巩固深化“不忘初心，牢记使命”主题教育成果学习活动的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2020-11-23",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    \n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">流动党员：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 按照中心党总支《巩固深化“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育成果学习方案》要求，为深入学习贯彻习近平总书记新时代中国特色社会主义思想，巩固深化“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育成果，不断提高两个维护的定力和能力，流动党员支部定于11月23日-12月11日开展巩固深化“不忘初心，牢记使命”主题教育成果学习活动，学习“四史”，通过“四史”教育不断叩问初心，砥砺担当使命 。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;学习形式为自学，要求每名党员学习结束后上交学习心得一篇。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 流动党员支部&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2020年11月23日</p>\n\n\n                ",
